{title: Piya Basanti Re}
{artist: Ustad Sultan Khan Chithra}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Piya [E]basanti re
[A]kaahe sataaye aaja
[A]Jaane kya jaadu kiya,
[A]pyaar ki dhun chhede jiya
[E]O... kaahe [A]sataaye aaja
[D]Oo.. baadal ne [A]angdaayi li jo kabhi
[D]Lehraaya dharti [E]ka aanchal
[D]Yeh patta patta [A]yeh buta buta
[D]Chhede hai [E]kaisi yeh halchal
[D]Manawa yeh dole [A]jaane kya bole
[A]Maanega na mera jiya
[A]tere hain ham tere piya
[E]O kaahe [A]sataaye aaja
[A]Piya [E]basanti re.....
[A]Palako ke sirhaane baithe
[E]khwaab wahi jo aane waale
[D]Dil ki giraha giraha khole
[A]mann mein pyaar jagaane waale
[A]Satrangi [E]sapne [A]bole re
[A]kaahe sataaye aaja
[A]Piya [E]basanti re.....
